## Category 4: Oracle & Price Manipulation (5 patterns)

### 16. Spot Price Manipulation
```solidity
// VULNERABLE - using AMM spot price
uint256 price = reserve0 / reserve1;  // Manipulable with flash loan

// SECURE - use TWAP or Chainlink
uint256 price = oracle.latestAnswer();
```

### 17. Stale Oracle Data
```solidity
// VULNERABLE
(, int256 price,,,) = oracle.latestRoundData();

// SECURE
(uint80 roundId, int256 price,, uint256 updatedAt,) = oracle.latestRoundData();
require(updatedAt > block.timestamp - 1 hours, "Stale");
require(price > 0, "Invalid price");
```

### 18. Oracle Decimals Mismatch
Not accounting for different decimal places between oracles.

### 19. Flash Loan Price Manipulation
Single-block price manipulation via massive swaps.

### 20. TWAP Manipulation
Long-term price manipulation over multiple blocks.

