## Category 5: Flash Loan Attacks (5 patterns)

### 21. Governance Flash Loan
Borrow tokens → Vote → Return tokens in same block.

### 22. Collateral Manipulation
Inflate collateral value → Borrow max → Dump collateral.

### 23. Reward Manipulation
Flash deposit → Claim rewards → Withdraw.

### 24. Liquidation Manipulation
Flash loan to avoid liquidation or trigger others'.

### 25. Arbitrage/Oracle Attack
Manipulate prices across protocols in single tx.

