## Category 10: Miscellaneous (5 patterns)

### 46. Signature Replay
```solidity
// VULNERABLE - no nonce
verify(hash, signature);

// SECURE - include nonce and chain ID
bytes32 hash = keccak256(abi.encodePacked(data, nonce, block.chainid));
```

### 47. Unsafe External Calls
Not checking return values of low-level calls.

### 48. DoS via Gas Limits
Unbounded loops consuming all gas.

### 49. Timestamp Dependence
Using `block.timestamp` for critical randomness.

### 50. Unchecked Return Data
Not validating data returned from external calls.

